    "detailed_description": "Venture forth, battle monsters, and find loot. <br>Build your party of characters.<br>Bruteforce, cunning, or adeptly wielding magic? <br>Adapt, or be decisive?<br>The choice is yours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An itemisation system with items of different types and rarities.<br>Each item has a set of random affixes.<br>Some affixes are simple bonuses to character stats.<br>Others grant combat abilities and effects.<br>Some of these abilities scale with different character or equipment stats.<br></li><li> 6 different classes to build your party with. <br>Each class bring a set of talents.<br>Classes are a starting point. <br>The talent system allow characters to be shaped in different ways.<br></li><li> A crafting system with runes. <br>Runes are consumable items that alter the properties of items.<br>There are 5 different kinds, each with its own usage area.<br></li><li> Turn based combat. <br>Combat takes place on a game board where units take turns attacking.<br>Stats, effects, and abilities of units shape the battle.</li></ul><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942140/extras/3575d99098f3b7526746e7fffcec3308.poster.avif?t=1729261359\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942140/extras/3575d99098f3b7526746e7fffcec3308.webm?t=1729261359\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942140/extras/3575d99098f3b7526746e7fffcec3308.mp4?t=1729261359\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942140/extras/22d951075500331f1ee98caed51500e0.poster.avif?t=1729261359\" width=576 